  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "野菜や　お肉などの　具材をパンで　はさんだ　料理。ピクニックで　食べるのに　最適。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "채소나 고기 등의 재료를 빵 사이에 끼운 요리. 피크닉에서 먹기 적당하다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "用麵包夾著蔬菜、肉類等材料而成。作為野餐料理再適合不過。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un casse-croûte composé de divers ingrédients, tels que des légumes ou de la viande, et servi entre deux tranches de pain. Idéal pour un pique-nique.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Dieses Gericht besteht aus verschiedenen Belägen wie Fleisch oder Gemüse, die zwischen zwei Scheiben Brot platziert werden. Der ideale Imbiss für ein Picknick.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un plato que consiste en verduras, carne u otros ingredientes entre dos rebanadas de pan, perfecto para consumir en un pícnic.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Una pietanza realizzata mettendo vari ingredienti come verdure o carne tra due fette di pane. Perfetto da mangiare durante i picnic.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A dish made by sandwiching vegetables, meat, or other ingredients between two pieces of bread. It makes a fantastic meal when out on a picnic.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "野菜や　お肉などの　具材をパンで　はさんだ　料理。ピクニックで　食べるのに　最適。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "使用面包夹着蔬菜和肉类等馅料制成的料理。最适合在野餐时食用。",
      "version_group": {
